    "Sapporo International Student Exchange Center – Hokkaido University Life Support for International Students\n[Overview]\n・Tenancy period：Available for a stay of six months or more, with the possibility of extension if conditions are met.\n・Eligible Residence Status for Tenancy：Only “Student”\n・Smoking policy：No Smoking in the Entire Building\n・Room Facilities：Shower and Toilet Included\n・Single room (for any gender)：Residents of various genders live on the same floor.\nSapporo International Student Center – Key Selling Points (English)\nHow to get to Sapporo International Student Exchange Center from New Chitose Airport (Japanese/English) (PDF)\nsingle use\nhousehold\nSapporo International Student Exchange Center: Single\nlocation\n6-jo 6-5-35 Toyohira, Toyohira-ku, Sapporo 062-0906\nGoogle Map\n*Around 35 minutes from the dormitory to Student Communication Station in the university by subway and walk\nnumber of rooms\n80 rooms\nInstallation year\nthe year of 2000\nThis dormitory is managed and operated by Sapporo City.\nLiving room area\n18m\n2\nAccommodation fee, etc.\n30,800 yen per month\nShared facilities\ndining room, kitchen, laundry room, study room, lounge, sports room\nLiving room facilities\nBed, desk, chair, desk lamp (desktop lighting), closet (shelf), shoebox, unit bath, hot water supply, refrigerator, telephone, heating\nOthers\nEquipped with internet (1,300 yen monthly usage fee)\nSapporo International Student Exchange Center: For households\nlocation\n6-jo 6-5-35 Toyohira, Toyohira-ku, Sapporo 062-0906\nGoogle Map\n*Around 35 minutes from the dormitory to Student Communication Station in the university by subway and walk\nnumber of rooms\n20 rooms\nInstallation year\nthe year of 2000\nThis dormitory is managed and operated by Sapporo City.\nLiving room area\n36m\n2\nAccommodation fee, etc.\n39,600 yen per month\nShared facilities\ndining room, kitchen, laundry room, study room, lounge, light sports room, trunk room\nLiving room facilities\nBed, desk, chair, desk lamp (desktop lighting), closet, shoe box, bathroom, toilet, kitchen, dining table, cupboard, hot water supply, refrigerator, microwave oven, telephone, washing machine, heating\nOthers\nEquipped with internet (1,300 yen monthly usage fee)\nSapporo International Student Center HP\nSapporo International Student Center Facebook\nSapporo International Student Center（HP of Sapporo city）\n〒062-0906 Sapporo City Toyohira Ward Toyohira 6-jo 6-chome 5-35\nSapporo International Student Center Office\nInquiry Form for Sapporo International Student Center\nAppearance of Sapporo International Student Exchange Center\nsingle room\ndining room\nstudy room\nhousehold(1)\nhousehold(2)\nhousehold(3)\nhousehold(4)\nhousehold(5)\nhousehold(6)\nLight sports room\nTweet\nシェア"
